WEBVTT

00:11:27.376 --> 00:11:31.864
Paul Bissonnette's 
glacier video, incredible.

00:11:31.864 --> 00:11:34.601
How about the redemption nuns of Dublin?

00:11:34.601 --> 00:11:36.306
Who's seen that one?

00:11:36.306 --> 00:11:38.893
It's absolutely fantastic.

00:11:38.893 --> 00:11:41.110
J.T., Justin Timberlake.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.879
That's when we knew, that 
was a real A-list celebrity.

00:11:44.879 --> 00:11:47.770
I go back on my texts, and I can see

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:52.902
"JT! JT!" My sister texting me.

00:11:52.902 --> 00:11:56.150
Angela Merkel, the chancellor of Germany.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.956
Incredible.

00:11:57.956 --> 00:12:00.266
And the ALS patients,